    Bug 2021953 - Remove nsIMsgWindow.domWindow and nsIMsgWindow.rootDocShell. r=babolivier


    For alert/confirm I'm using the topmost window as base. It wouldn't be terrible using null either (center screen),
    but this is slighly nicer.
    There's more to clean up but I'm refraining from furhter changes until after this is landed.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291176

